('739c2144-0381-5838-a8a4-8f7453f9a322','212d5b4b-d928-5245-8c9d-be65c1fa528b',1,'adjective','A2','S2','W2','( comparative thicker , superlative thickest )','[{"phrase":"be thick on the ground","register":null,"definition_en":"to be present or available in large amounts or numbers","translation":"وجود داشته باشد یا در مقادیر یا تعداد زیاد موجود باشد","example":"Cheap houses aren’t as thick on the ground as they used to be.","example_translation":"خانه های ارزان قیمت به ضخامت قبل روی زمین نیستند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000595455.mp3"},{"phrase":"be thick with somebody","register":"old-fashioned","definition_en":"to be very friendly with someone","translation":"با کسی خیلی دوست بودن","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('de654fb3-257f-575d-af1a-e64593582cf0','212d5b4b-d928-5245-8c9d-be65c1fa528b',2,'adverb','A2',null,null,null,'[{"phrase":"thick and fast","register":null,"definition_en":"arriving or happening very frequently, in large amounts or numbers","translation":"به صورت مکرر، در مقادیر یا تعداد زیاد می رسد یا اتفاق می افتد","example":"Entries have been coming in thick and fast.","example_translation":"ورودی ها به صورت ضخیم و سریع وارد شده اند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000595534.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('afd1fbb5-cb6c-5b32-bb21-658d5dac6994','212d5b4b-d928-5245-8c9d-be65c1fa528b',3,'noun','A2',null,null,null,'[{"phrase":"through thick and thin","register":null,"definition_en":"in spite of any difficulties or problems","translation":"با وجود هر مشکل یا مشکلی","example":"Then, families stuck together through thick and thin .","example_translation":"سپس، خانواده ها از ضخامت و نازکی به هم چسبیدند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000595558.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('7bfb74db-9ba2-5064-83b2-3756f9d1c571','91087128-2b9b-598f-84cd-dc2af780443d',1,'noun','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"the thing is","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used when you are going to explain something, give the reason for something, or give an opinion","translation":"زمانی استفاده می شود که می خواهید چیزی را توضیح دهید، دلیل چیزی را بیاورید یا نظر بدهید","example":"‘It sounds like a good idea. Why don’t you invest?’ ‘Well, the thing is, I can’t afford to.’","example_translation":"\"به نظر ایده خوبی است. چرا سرمایه گذاری نمی کنی؟» «خب، مسئله این است که من نمی توانم هزینه کنم.»","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596211.mp3"},{"phrase":"first thing","register":null,"definition_en":"as soon as you get up in the morning, or as soon as you start work","translation":"به محض اینکه صبح بیدار می شوید یا به محض شروع کار","example":"I’ll call you first thing tomorrow.","example_translation":"فردا اول باهات تماس میگیرم","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001259503.mp3"},{"phrase":"among other things","register":null,"definition_en":"used when you are giving one fact, reason , effect etc but want to suggest that there are many others","translation":"زمانی استفاده می‌شود که یک واقعیت، دلیل، اثر و غیره را ارائه می‌دهید، اما می‌خواهید پیشنهاد کنید که بسیاری دیگر وجود دارد","example":"The substance is used in the manufacture of cosmetics and drugs, among other things.","example_translation":"این ماده از جمله در ساخت لوازم آرایشی و مواد مخدر استفاده می شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799811.mp3"},{"phrase":"for one thing","register":null,"definition_en":"used to introduce a reason for what you have just said","translation":"برای معرفی دلیلی برای آنچه شما گفتید استفاده می شود","example":"He couldn’t bring himself to say what he thought. For one thing , she seldom stopped to listen. For another , he doubted that he could make himself clear.","example_translation":"او نمی توانست خود را به گفتن آنچه که فکر می کند مجبور کند. برای یک چیز، او به ندرت توقف می کرد تا گوش کند. برای دیگری، او شک داشت که بتواند خودش را روشن کند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557980.mp3"},{"phrase":"be a thing of the past","register":null,"definition_en":"to no longer exist or happen","translation":"دیگر وجود نداشته باشد یا اتفاق بیفتد","example":"Before AIDS, many health care experts believed that large-scale infectious diseases were a thing of the past.","example_translation":"قبل از ایدز، بسیاری از متخصصان مراقبت های بهداشتی معتقد بودند که بیماری های عفونی در مقیاس بزرگ متعلق به گذشته است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596167.mp3"},{"phrase":"something is just one of those things","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that something unpleasant or unlucky cannot be prevented","translation":"قبلاً می گفت که نمی توان از چیزی ناخوشایند یا بدشانسی جلوگیری کرد","example":"It wasn’t really the driver’s fault; it was just one of those things.","example_translation":"واقعاً تقصیر راننده نبود. این فقط یکی از آن چیزها بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596256.mp3"},{"phrase":"of all things","register":null,"definition_en":"used to show that you are surprised or shocked by something that someone has done or said","translation":"برای نشان دادن اینکه از کاری که کسی انجام داده یا گفته است متعجب یا شوکه شده اید استفاده می شود","example":"She gave up a promising career as a stockbroker to become a weaver, of all things.","example_translation":"او یک حرفه امیدوارکننده به عنوان دلال سهام را رها کرد تا بافنده همه چیز شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596286.mp3"},{"phrase":"do your own thing","register":"informal","definition_en":"to do something in the way that you like instead of copying other people or following strict rules","translation":"به جای کپی کردن از دیگران یا پیروی از قوانین سختگیرانه، کاری را به روشی که دوست دارید انجام دهید","example":"I just want to live my own life and do my own thing.","example_translation":"من فقط می خواهم زندگی خودم را داشته باشم و کار خودم را انجام دهم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596173.mp3"},{"phrase":"all things considered","register":null,"definition_en":"a US news programme broadcast in the evening on National Public Radio stations","translation":"یک برنامه خبری ایالات متحده که در شب از ایستگاه های رادیویی عمومی ملی پخش می شود","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"be onto a good thing","register":"informal","definition_en":"to have found an easy way of being successful or getting what you want","translation":"یک راه آسان برای موفقیت یا رسیدن به آنچه می خواهید پیدا کرده اید","example":"Andrew knew when he was onto a good thing.","example_translation":"اندرو می دانست که چه زمانی به یک چیز خوب رسیده است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001723114.mp3"},{"phrase":"the done thing","register":"old-fashioned","definition_en":"the way of behaving or doing something that is socially acceptable","translation":"شیوه رفتار یا انجام کاری که از نظر اجتماعی قابل قبول است","example":"It is not the done thing for teachers to hit children.","example_translation":"کتک زدن کودکان توسط معلمان کار انجام شده نیست.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596151.mp3"},{"phrase":"what with one thing and another","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to explain that you have had a lot of work, problems , or jobs that you had to do","translation":"برای توضیح اینکه شما کارها، مشکلات یا کارهای زیادی داشته اید که باید انجام می دادید","example":"I’ve been so busy these last few days, what with one thing and another.","example_translation":"این چند روز خیلی سرم شلوغ بود، یک چیز و یک چیز دیگر.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596271.mp3"},{"phrase":"one thing leads to another","register":null,"definition_en":"used to explain how a series of events caused something to happen without giving any details","translation":"برای توضیح اینکه چگونه یک سری از رویدادها باعث اتفاق افتادن چیزی بدون ارائه جزئیات می شود","example":"One thing led to another and, before I knew it, I had invited her family to stay.","example_translation":"یک چیز به چیز دیگری منجر شد و قبل از اینکه بدانم خانواده او را دعوت کرده بودم که بمانند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799831.mp3"},{"phrase":"taking one thing with another","register":null,"definition_en":"considering all the facts","translation":"با در نظر گرفتن تمام حقایق","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"do things to somebody","register":null,"definition_en":"to have a strong effect on someone","translation":"تاثیر قوی روی کسی گذاشتن","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516','fb5640bb-e59f-57cc-b289-a140e02a63c9',1,'verb','A1','S1','W1','( past tense and past participle thought / θɔːt $ θɒːt / )','[{"phrase":"think twice","register":null,"definition_en":"to think very carefully before deciding to do something, because you know about the dangers or problems","translation":"قبل از تصمیم گیری برای انجام کاری بسیار با دقت فکر کنید، زیرا از خطرات یا مشکلات آگاه هستید","example":"A visible alarm makes burglars think twice.","example_translation":"یک زنگ هشدار قابل مشاهده، سارقان را وادار می کند دو بار فکر کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799942.mp3"},{"phrase":"think again","register":null,"definition_en":"to think carefully about a plan, decision, idea etc, especially with the result that you change your mind or do something differently","translation":"به دقت در مورد یک برنامه، تصمیم، ایده و غیره فکر کنید، به خصوص در نتیجه اینکه نظر خود را تغییر دهید یا کاری متفاوت انجام دهید.","example":"If you think car crime can’t happen to you, think again.","example_translation":"اگر فکر می کنید جرایم خودرو نمی تواند برای شما اتفاق بیفتد، دوباره فکر کنید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799949.mp3"},{"phrase":"who would have thought?","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that something is very surprising","translation":"می گفت که چیزی بسیار تعجب آور است","example":"Who would have thought she’d end up dancing for a living?","example_translation":"چه کسی فکرش را می کرد که او در نهایت برای امرار معاش رقصید؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840847.mp3"},{"phrase":"think better of it","register":null,"definition_en":"to not do something that you had planned to do, because you realize that it is not a good idea","translation":"کاری را که برای انجام آن برنامه ریزی کرده بودید انجام ندهید، زیرا متوجه می شوید که این ایده خوبی نیست","example":"He started to say something, then thought better of it.","example_translation":"شروع کرد به گفتن چیزی، بعد بهتر فکر کرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840863.mp3"},{"phrase":"think nothing of doing something","register":null,"definition_en":"to think that a particular activity is normal or easy , even though other people think it is unusual or difficult","translation":"فکر کردن به اینکه یک فعالیت خاص عادی یا آسان است، حتی اگر دیگران آن را غیرعادی یا دشوار بدانند","example":"He thinks nothing of staying up all night in casinos.","example_translation":"او فکر نمی کند تمام شب در کازینو بیدار بماند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840868.mp3"},{"phrase":"think nothing of something","register":null,"definition_en":"to think that something is not important and then realize later that it is important","translation":"فکر کنید که چیزی مهم نیست و بعداً متوجه شوید که آن چیز مهم است","example":"I had a pain in my back but thought nothing of it at the time.","example_translation":"کمرم درد میکرد ولی اون موقع فکر نمیکردم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840873.mp3"},{"phrase":"not think to do something","register":null,"definition_en":"to not consider doing something, especially when you later wish you had done it","translation":"به انجام کاری فکر نکنید، به خصوص زمانی که بعداً آرزو می کنید که ای کاش آن کار را انجام می دادید","example":"I didn’t think to question the treatment I was given.","example_translation":"فکر نمی‌کردم که درمانم را زیر سوال ببرم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840881.mp3"},{"phrase":"think for yourself","register":null,"definition_en":"to have ideas and thoughts of your own rather than believing what other people say","translation":"به جای اینکه به آنچه دیگران می گویند باور داشته باشید، ایده ها و افکار خود را داشته باشید","example":"Parents have to teach their children to think for themselves.","example_translation":"والدین باید به فرزندان خود بیاموزند که خودشان فکر کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596406.mp3"},{"phrase":"think aloud","register":null,"definition_en":"to say what you are thinking, without talking to anyone in particular","translation":"برای گفتن آنچه به آن فکر می کنید، بدون اینکه با شخص خاصی صحبت کنید","example":"Oh, sorry. I was thinking aloud.","example_translation":"اوه متاسفم با صدای بلند فکر می کردم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596426.mp3"},{"phrase":"think straight","register":null,"definition_en":"to think clearly","translation":"روشن فکر کردن","example":"I’m so nervous I can’t think straight.","example_translation":"من آنقدر عصبی هستم که نمی توانم درست فکر کنم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799997.mp3"},{"phrase":"think the world of somebody","register":"informal","definition_en":"to like or love someone very much","translation":"دوست داشتن یا دوست داشتن کسی","example":"The children think the world of her.","example_translation":"بچه ها دنیای او را فکر می کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596436.mp3"},{"phrase":"think badly of somebody","register":"formal","definition_en":"to disapprove of someone or what they have done","translation":"عدم تایید کسی یا کاری که انجام داده است","example":"Please don’t think badly of me.","example_translation":"لطفا در مورد من فکر بد نکن","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596441.mp3"},{"phrase":"think big","register":"informal","definition_en":"to plan to do things that are difficult , but will be very impressive , make a lot of profit etc","translation":"برنامه ریزی برای انجام کارهایی که دشوار هستند، اما بسیار چشمگیر خواهند بود، سود زیادی به دست آورند و غیره","example":"The company is thinking big.","example_translation":"این شرکت به بزرگی فکر می کند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596457.mp3"},{"phrase":"think outside the box","register":null,"definition_en":"to think of new, different , or unusual ways of doing something, especially in business","translation":"فکر کردن به راه‌های جدید، متفاوت یا غیرعادی برای انجام کاری، مخصوصاً در تجارت","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"think on your feet","register":null,"definition_en":"to think of ideas and make decisions very quickly","translation":"فکر کردن به ایده ها و تصمیم گیری خیلی سریع","example":"In this job you need to be able to think on your feet.","example_translation":"در این شغل باید بتوانید روی پای خود فکر کنید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596462.mp3"},{"phrase":"think to do something","register":"literary","definition_en":"to try to do something","translation":"تلاش برای انجام کاری","example":"They had thought to deceive me.","example_translation":"فکر کرده بودند مرا فریب دهند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596468.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('7daedb9f-3a09-500c-ac1a-b97607445fd6','fb5640bb-e59f-57cc-b289-a140e02a63c9',2,'noun','A1',null,null,null,'[]'::jsonb),
