('dac02e96-1341-51ca-b132-07cb2739bcba','8e2b793f-d775-53b1-9514-b3b55aa50432',1,'preposition','B2','S3','W2',null,'[{"phrase":"be beside yourself","register":null,"definition_en":"to be feeling so angry , excited etc that you find it difficult to control yourself","translation":"آنقدر احساس عصبانیت، هیجان و غیره داشته باشید که کنترل خود را برایتان مشکل باشد","example":"The poor girl was almost beside herself.","example_translation":"دختر بیچاره تقریباً کنار خودش بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653978.mp3"},{"phrase":"be beside the point","register":null,"definition_en":"to not be directly connected with the main subject or problem that you are talking about","translation":"به طور مستقیم با موضوع یا مشکل اصلی که در مورد آن صحبت می کنید در ارتباط نباشید","example":"He’s very charming, but that’s beside the point.","example_translation":"او بسیار جذاب است، اما این در کنار موضوع است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001842007.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('cbf623ba-9cc8-55b0-acbb-8c92f1b58611','6b1eb5e6-4d56-5e4f-91f0-ad0dddda629e',1,'adjective','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"get better","register":null,"definition_en":"to improve","translation":"برای بهبود","example":"Her English isn’t really getting any better.","example_translation":"انگلیسی او واقعاً بهتر نمی شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016468.mp3"},{"phrase":"no better","register":null,"definition_en":"not better than something else or something before","translation":"بهتر از چیز دیگری یا چیزی قبل نیست","example":"The following day the weather was no better.","example_translation":"روز بعد هوا بهتر نبود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654300.mp3"},{"phrase":"nothing better","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that you really like something or think that something is very good","translation":"می گفت که شما واقعاً چیزی را دوست دارید یا فکر می کنید که چیزی بسیار خوب است","example":"She likes nothing better than a nice long walk along the beach.","example_translation":"او هیچ چیز را بهتر از یک پیاده روی طولانی در کنار ساحل دوست ندارد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654314.mp3"},{"phrase":"better late than never","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that it is better for someone or something to be late than never to arrive or happen at all","translation":"می گفت بهتر است کسی یا چیزی دیر شود تا اینکه اصلاً نیاید یا اتفاقی نیفتد","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('2211bdd1-6730-52c4-8de5-c8a32cefbd04','6b1eb5e6-4d56-5e4f-91f0-ad0dddda629e',2,'adverb','A1','S1','W1','[ comparative of well ]','[{"phrase":"do better","register":null,"definition_en":"to perform better or reach a higher standard","translation":"برای عملکرد بهتر یا رسیدن به استاندارد بالاتر","example":"We did better than all the other schools.","example_translation":"ما بهتر از بقیه مدارس عمل کردیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016615.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('aa36ea3a-2182-5a23-8209-4fb497462783','6b1eb5e6-4d56-5e4f-91f0-ad0dddda629e',3,'noun','A1',null,null,null,'[{"phrase":"the better","register":null,"definition_en":"the one that is higher in quality, more suitable etc when you are comparing two similar people or things","translation":"هنگامی که شما دو شخص یا چیز مشابه را با هم مقایسه می کنید، از نظر کیفیت بالاتر، مناسب تر و غیره است","example":"It’s hard to decide which one’s the better.","example_translation":"سخت است تصمیم بگیرید که کدام یک بهتر است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016655.mp3"},{"phrase":"get the better of somebody","register":null,"definition_en":"if your feelings or wishes get the better of you, they make you behave in a way you would not normally behave","translation":"اگر احساسات یا آرزوهای شما بهتر شود، باعث می شوند طوری رفتار کنید که معمولاً رفتار نمی کنید.","example":"My curiosity finally got the better of me and I opened the letter.","example_translation":"بالاخره کنجکاوی من را فرا گرفت و نامه را باز کردم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016661.mp3"},{"phrase":"for the better","register":null,"definition_en":"in a way that improves the situation","translation":"به نحوی که وضعیت را بهبود بخشد","example":"a definite change for the better","example_translation":"یک تغییر قطعی برای بهتر شدن","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016671.mp3"},{"phrase":"so much the better","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that something would be even better or bring even more advantages","translation":"می گفت که چیزی حتی بهتر است یا مزایای بیشتری به همراه خواهد داشت","example":"If they can do them both at the same time, then so much the better.","example_translation":"اگر بتوانند هر دو را همزمان انجام دهند، خیلی بهتر است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016687.mp3"},{"phrase":"be all the better for something","register":null,"definition_en":"to be improved by a particular action , change etc","translation":"با یک اقدام خاص، تغییر و غیره بهبود یابد","example":"I think it’s all the better for that extra ten minutes’ cooking.","example_translation":"من فکر می کنم برای آن ده دقیقه پخت اضافی بهتر است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016682.mp3"},{"phrase":"your betters","register":"old-fashioned","definition_en":"people who are more important than you or deserve more respect","translation":"افرادی که از شما مهمتر هستند یا سزاوار احترام بیشتری هستند","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('72048dc1-c033-5f55-bb63-3640e4a195c5','6b1eb5e6-4d56-5e4f-91f0-ad0dddda629e',4,'verb','A1',null,null,'[ transitive ]','[{"phrase":"better yourself","register":null,"definition_en":"to improve your position in society by getting a better education or earning more money","translation":"برای بهبود موقعیت خود در جامعه با تحصیل بهتر یا کسب درآمد بیشتر","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('be4f5fab-168d-5d56-b938-a5359657028b','689073b8-076b-5768-9689-d5ff765c95de',1,'preposition','B2','S2','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"be beyond somebody","register":null,"definition_en":"to be too difficult for someone to understand","translation":"خیلی سخت بودن برای کسی","example":"The whole problem was quite beyond him.","example_translation":"کل مشکل کاملا فراتر از او بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001837532.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('96ffd0dc-6fb9-578d-bbf4-7210eea9433b','689073b8-076b-5768-9689-d5ff765c95de',2,'noun','B2',null,null,null,'[{"phrase":"the beyond","register":"literary","definition_en":"whatever comes after this life","translation":"هر چه بعد از این زندگی می آید","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('4b5708dc-7cd2-57de-b0b8-91b470fb3cdc','1c0c7823-5880-5c68-8e8c-f0c1e34b39a3',1,'adjective','B2','S3','W3',null,'[{"phrase":"to the bitter end","register":null,"definition_en":"continuing until the end, even though this is difficult","translation":"تا انتها ادامه دهیم، اگرچه این کار دشوار است","example":"Employees have vowed to fight the closure to the bitter end .","example_translation":"کارمندان قول داده اند که تا پایان تلخ با بسته شدن مبارزه کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001020058.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
