('f4e989a6-dbf6-5d6c-9ba5-8e6d7a332f0e','5ec048ff-de66-5180-9666-14084e69cfae',1,'research','تحقیق کنید','spoken & written','a piece of work that is done to find out more about a particular subject or problem, and usually includes a written report','[ countable ]','case study','مطالعه، بررسی (پژوهش)؛ مطالعه (فرد)؛ اتاق مطالعه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do a study/carry out a study ( also conduct a study formal ) The scientists are carrying out a study into the effects of global warming.','a study finds something The study found that men were more likely to take risks.','a study shows something Studies have shown that the drug works.','a study suggests/indicates something A British study suggests that older drivers are safer drivers.','a study reveals something (= shows something, especially something surprising ) A recent study revealed that 74% of donuts are bought on impulse.','a study confirms something (= shows that something is true ) The study confirms what we all know – smoking is also bad for the people around you.','a study aims to do something The study aimed to identify the housing needs of local people.','publish a study The study was published in the British Medical Journal.','fund a study (= pay for it ) The study was funded by a major US drugs company.','commission a study (= ask someone to carry out a study ) The government has commissioned a study into the health of residents living near the power station.','a research study Research studies have found that young people are drinking no more than they were 20 years ago.','a detailed study ( also an in-depth study ) They carried out a detailed study into the effects of the disease on mice.','a two-year/three-month etc study They are engaged in a five-year study into the effects of calcium on bone health.','a huge/massive study The journal published the results of a massive study of 87,000 women.','a previous/earlier study The report is a summary of the work done in earlier studies.','a pilot study (= one done to find out if something will be successful ) The government has just completed a pilot study, with some encouraging results.','a feasibility study (= one done to find out if something is possible or practical ) They commissioned a feasibility study into re-opening the whole railway line.','the aims of a study The aims of this study are to examine the reliability of current techniques.','the results/findings of a study The results of this study suggest that the drug is effective in over 80% of cases. His research confirmed the findings of earlier studies.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Recent studies show that women still get paid a lot less than men.","translation":"مطالعات اخیر نشان می دهد که زنان هنوز هم بسیار کمتر از مردان حقوق می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627301.mp3"},{"sentence":"a study of Australian wild birds","translation":"مطالعه پرندگان وحشی استرالیا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623952.mp3"},{"sentence":"The study was carried out between January and May 2008.","translation":"این مطالعه بین ژانویه و می 2008 انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627305.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9a112e2c-28ad-5ee8-9aa0-a8398a317e79','5ec048ff-de66-5180-9666-14084e69cfae',2,'learning','یادگیری','spoken & written','when you spend time learning, especially at home or by yourself rather than during school','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی زمانی را صرف یادگیری می کنید، به خصوص در خانه یا خودتان به جای مدرسه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do a study/carry out a study ( also conduct a study formal ) The scientists are carrying out a study into the effects of global warming.','a study finds something The study found that men were more likely to take risks.','a study shows something Studies have shown that the drug works.','a study suggests/indicates something A British study suggests that older drivers are safer drivers.','a study reveals something (= shows something, especially something surprising ) A recent study revealed that 74% of donuts are bought on impulse.','a study confirms something (= shows that something is true ) The study confirms what we all know – smoking is also bad for the people around you.','a study aims to do something The study aimed to identify the housing needs of local people.','publish a study The study was published in the British Medical Journal.','fund a study (= pay for it ) The study was funded by a major US drugs company.','commission a study (= ask someone to carry out a study ) The government has commissioned a study into the health of residents living near the power station.','a research study Research studies have found that young people are drinking no more than they were 20 years ago.','a detailed study ( also an in-depth study ) They carried out a detailed study into the effects of the disease on mice.','a two-year/three-month etc study They are engaged in a five-year study into the effects of calcium on bone health.','a huge/massive study The journal published the results of a massive study of 87,000 women.','a previous/earlier study The report is a summary of the work done in earlier studies.','a pilot study (= one done to find out if something will be successful ) The government has just completed a pilot study, with some encouraging results.','a feasibility study (= one done to find out if something is possible or practical ) They commissioned a feasibility study into re-opening the whole railway line.','the aims of a study The aims of this study are to examine the reliability of current techniques.','the results/findings of a study The results of this study suggest that the drug is effective in over 80% of cases. His research confirmed the findings of earlier studies.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Set aside a period of time specifically for study.","translation":"یک دوره زمانی را به طور خاص برای مطالعه در نظر بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623967.mp3"},{"sentence":"ways to improve study skills (= skills that help you study efficiently and be successful in school )","translation":"راه هایی برای بهبود مهارت های مطالعه (= مهارت هایی که به شما کمک می کند کارآمد مطالعه کنید و در مدرسه موفق باشید)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627314.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
