('236c9e4e-5b41-57b8-9cf9-e0974ef3e9eb','9d7de4fd-3e83-5893-8bc9-e645d8fd8947',9,'group','گروه','spoken & written','the group of people sitting around a table',null,null,'گروهی که دور یک میز نشسته اند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['set/lay the table (= put knives, forks etc on a table before a meal ) The table was set for fourteen.','clear the table (= take plates etc off ) Do you want me to clear the table?','sit at a table He was sitting at a corner table.','sit around a table We sat around the table and talked.','get up from/leave the table She stood up from her chair and left the table.','book/reserve a table (= in a restaurant ) I''ve booked a table for four at a local restaurant.','dinner/breakfast table Will you clear the breakfast table?','bedside/kitchen/dining-room table They were chatting around the kitchen table.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His stories kept the whole table amused.","translation":"داستان های او کل میز را سرگرم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000608605.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
