('f3a45138-64ca-5dc4-a7a8-cf040d199f63','1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516',1,'opinion/belief','نظر/باور','spoken & written','to have a particular opinion or to believe that something is true','[ transitive ]',null,'اندیشیدن، فکر کردن (به)؛ پنداشتن (که)؛ به حساب آوردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I think that you’re being unfair.","translation":"من فکر می کنم که شما بی انصافی می کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596344.mp3"},{"sentence":"I thought I heard something.","translation":"فکر کردم یه چیزی شنیدم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596345.mp3"},{"sentence":"He didn’t think anyone would believe him.","translation":"او فکر نمی کرد کسی او را باور کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596346.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you think I should call him?","translation":"به نظرت باید بهش زنگ بزنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799861.mp3"},{"sentence":"For some reason, I keep thinking it’s Friday today.","translation":"بنا به دلایلی مدام فکر می کنم امروز جمعه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799862.mp3"},{"sentence":"The recession lasted longer than anyone thought it would.","translation":"رکود بیش از آن چیزی که کسی فکرش را می کرد دوام آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799863.mp3"},{"sentence":"Am I right in thinking that you have a brother?","translation":"آیا من درست فکر می کنم که شما یک برادر دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799864.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t help thinking that he’s made a mistake.","translation":"نمی توانم فکر نکنم که او اشتباه کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799867.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you honestly think I would do something so stupid?","translation":"راستش فکر میکنی من اینقدر کار احمقانه انجام میدم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799870.mp3"},{"sentence":"What do you think of your new school?","translation":"نظرت در مورد مدرسه جدیدت چیه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799877.mp3"},{"sentence":"I thought it best to call first.","translation":"فکر کردم بهتره اول زنگ بزنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799879.mp3"},{"sentence":"I thought it appropriate to invite her to speak at the meeting.","translation":"مناسب دیدم که از او برای سخنرانی در جلسه دعوت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596359.mp3"},{"sentence":"We must start thinking in terms of reducing costs.","translation":"باید به فکر کاهش هزینه ها باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799880.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fraud is thought to be costing software companies millions of dollars a year.","translation":"تصور می‌شود که تقلب سالانه میلیون‌ها دلار برای شرکت‌های نرم‌افزار زیان وارد می‌کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596363.mp3"}]'::jsonb,14),
('54cd14b9-2a5b-569e-a7fa-2ad695376c15','1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516',2,'use your mind','از ذهنت استفاده کن','spoken & written','to use your mind to decide about something, form an opinion, imagine something etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'استفاده از ذهن برای تصمیم گیری در مورد چیزی، ایجاد نظر، تصور چیزی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carefully Think carefully about every spending decision you make.','hard (= with a lot of mental effort ) I bet, if you think really hard, you can think of something to do.','deeply I should have thought more deeply before I agreed.','seriously I thought seriously about my doctor’s advice.','clearly She was simply too tired to think clearly.','long and hard (= hard, for a long time, before making a decision ) I thought long and hard about taking the role.','I dread/hate/shudder to think (= I do not want to think about something bad ) I dread to think what might have happened if we hadn’t found her.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She thought very carefully before answering.","translation":"قبل از جواب دادن خیلی خوب فکر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596369.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wait a minute – I’m thinking.","translation":"یک لحظه صبر کنید - دارم فکر می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596370.mp3"},{"sentence":"She lay awake thinking about the money.","translation":"بیدار دراز کشیده بود و به پول فکر می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596373.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t think what else we could have done.","translation":"من نمی توانم فکر کنم چه کار دیگری می توانستیم انجام دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799890.mp3"},{"sentence":"She thought very hard before deciding to leave her job.","translation":"قبل از اینکه تصمیم بگیرد کارش را ترک کند خیلی فکر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799894.mp3"},{"sentence":"Holmes sat thinking deeply (= thinking in a serious and careful way ) .","translation":"هلمز نشسته بود و عمیقاً فکر می کرد (= با جدیت و دقت فکر می کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799895.mp3"},{"sentence":"I dread to think how much this call is going to cost.","translation":"من می ترسم فکر کنم این تماس چقدر هزینه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799903.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('7af3a16a-76e0-5fc5-8d13-cfa49e3ed928','1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516',3,'have an idea','ایده داشته باشید','spoken & written','to have words or ideas in your mind without telling them to anyone','[ transitive ]',null,'کلمات یا ایده هایی در ذهن خود داشته باشید بدون اینکه آنها را به کسی بگویید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘How strange!’ he thought.","translation":"فکر کرد: «چقدر عجیب!»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596385.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I don’t care!’ she thought to herself .","translation":"با خودش فکر کرد: \"من مهم نیستم!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799912.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was impossible to know what he was thinking.","translation":"غیرممکن بود که بدانم او به چه چیزی فکر می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000596384.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was just thinking what a lovely time we had yesterday.","translation":"فقط داشتم فکر می کردم دیروز چه لحظات خوبی داشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799918.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('fcb99658-da7f-5065-9578-1785362afd74','1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516',4,'remember','به یاد داشته باشید','spoken & written','to remember something','[ transitive ]',null,'به یاد آوردن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was trying to think where he’d seen her before.","translation":"او سعی می کرد فکر کند که قبلا او را کجا دیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799926.mp3"},{"sentence":"I couldn’t think where I’d left my keys.","translation":"نمی توانستم فکر کنم کلیدهایم را کجا گذاشته ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799927.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7d8249a3-9328-5826-b5ac-1fb924137e10','1cef519a-d970-5f46-89b8-1ae1e572a516',5,'consider somebody/something','در نظر گرفتن کسی / چیزی','spoken & written','to consider that someone or something is a particular thing or has a particular quality','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'در نظر گرفتن اینکه کسی یا چیزی چیز خاصی است یا کیفیت خاصی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Peter had always thought of Kate as someone to be avoided.","translation":"پیتر همیشه کیت را به عنوان کسی که باید از او دوری کرد فکر می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799934.mp3"},{"sentence":"I want you to think of this as your home.","translation":"می خواهم این را خانه خود بدانی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799935.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve always thought of myself as a sensible person.","translation":"من همیشه خودم را فردی معقول می دانستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799938.mp3"},{"sentence":"My parents never thought me capable of doing a degree.","translation":"پدر و مادرم هرگز فکر نمی کردند که بتوانم مدرک بگیرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799941.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have good reason to think kindly of (= consider in an approving way ) a school that has provided all our children with an excellent education.","translation":"ما دلیل خوبی داریم که با مهربانی به مدرسه ای فکر کنیم (= به شیوه ای تایید کننده) مدرسه ای که به همه فرزندان ما آموزش عالی ارائه کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001834550.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
