('23cd6eb4-3ce9-513b-b30d-5cd9f7ee4b62','e1cc6dbb-927a-5174-8b9f-2b906aebca27',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a subject that people talk or write about',null,null,'موضوع، بحث؛ موضوع (گفتار)؛ موضوع (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a topic of conversation Her favourite topic of conversation is herself.','a topic of discussion/debate The issue is a topic of great debate in the record industry.','the main topic The main topics covered are finance, health and leisure.','an important topic The legal team will discuss a number of important topics.','a hot topic (= one that a lot of people are discussing or arguing about ) Gangs and drugs are the hot topics in this district.','a controversial topic (= one that causes a lot of disagreement, because many people have strong opinions about it ) Abortion is one of the most controversial topics in America today.','a sensitive topic (= one that must be dealt with very carefully, because it may offend people ) It is unusual for a judge to speak publicly about a sensitive topic such as religion.','cover a topic The book covers such topics as business strategy and marketing.','discuss a topic We discussed a range of topics.','raise/bring up a topic (= start talking about it ) It’s still a very difficult topic to raise.','leave a topic (= stop talking about it ) Before we leave this topic, may I add one more thing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The environment is a popular topic these days.","translation":"محیط زیست این روزها موضوعی پرطرفدار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000578896.mp3"},{"sentence":"We shall return to the topic of education in Chapter 7.","translation":"ما در فصل هفتم به موضوع آموزش باز خواهیم گشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729767.mp3"},{"sentence":"The wedding has been the only topic of conversation for weeks.","translation":"عروسی تنها موضوع گفتگو برای هفته ها بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729770.mp3"},{"sentence":"The main topic for discussion will be the proposed new supermarket.","translation":"موضوع اصلی بحث، سوپرمارکت جدید پیشنهادی خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729771.mp3"},{"sentence":"a wide range of topics","translation":"طیف گسترده ای از موضوعات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729775.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('ad133735-193c-50e4-9ae0-adc3e69640f8','9eed7e84-8d3d-54da-82a4-692d5ddb5f41',1,null,null,'spoken & written','complete , or as great as is possible','[ usually before noun ]',null,'کل، تمام؛ مجموع (مقدار)؛ مطلق (بی‌اعتنا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The sales campaign was a total disaster.","translation":"کمپین فروش یک فاجعه کامل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579902.mp3"},{"sentence":"a total ban on cigarette advertising","translation":"ممنوعیت کامل تبلیغات سیگار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579903.mp3"},{"sentence":"He looked at her with a total lack of comprehension.","translation":"با فقدان درک کامل به او نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729895.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sport that demands total commitment","translation":"ورزشی که نیازمند تعهد کامل است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729899.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('463f9563-3f28-56dc-b9ff-ee4189420ae2','9eed7e84-8d3d-54da-82a4-692d5ddb5f41',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'total number/amount/cost etc','کل، تمام؛ مجموع (مقدار)؛ مطلق (بی‌اعتنا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('966682e4-2381-5f03-9892-f6b827d85db6','bcf16f82-3026-59fe-9d63-83b5f7de5d53',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the final number or amount of things, people etc when everything has been counted',null,null,'مجموع، جمع (مقدار)؛ جمع کل (بازی)؛ مجموع (اسناد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a total of 100 etc The £1,750 raised by staff has been matched by the company, making a total of £3,500.','bring the total to 100 etc Police arrested more than 200 protesters yesterday, bringing the total detained to nearly 500.','add to a total He wants to add to his total of three Olympic gold medals.','the final total Mrs Menzies said the final total could be as much as £750.','the sum total (= the whole of an amount, when everything is added together ) This was the sum total of her grandfather''s possessions.','a combined/overall total (= the sum of two or more amounts added together ) The Jones family has a combined total of 143 years'' service with the company.','an annual/monthly/weekly/daily total The Government plans to increase the annual total of 2,500 adoptions by up to 50%.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s £7 and £3.50, so the total is £10.50.","translation":"این 7 پوند و 3.50 پوند است، بنابراین کل 10.50 پوند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729902.mp3"},{"sentence":"A total of thirteen meetings were held to discuss the issue.","translation":"در مجموع سیزده جلسه برای بررسی این موضوع برگزار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579924.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were probably about 40 people there in total.","translation":"احتمالاً در مجموع حدود 40 نفر آنجا بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579927.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fde88af1-f574-5de6-aadc-7e908925ad71','bcf16f82-3026-59fe-9d63-83b5f7de5d53',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'grand total','مجموع، جمع (مقدار)؛ جمع کل (بازی)؛ مجموع (اسناد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a total of 100 etc The £1,750 raised by staff has been matched by the company, making a total of £3,500.','bring the total to 100 etc Police arrested more than 200 protesters yesterday, bringing the total detained to nearly 500.','add to a total He wants to add to his total of three Olympic gold medals.','the final total Mrs Menzies said the final total could be as much as £750.','the sum total (= the whole of an amount, when everything is added together ) This was the sum total of her grandfather''s possessions.','a combined/overall total (= the sum of two or more amounts added together ) The Jones family has a combined total of 143 years'' service with the company.','an annual/monthly/weekly/daily total The Government plans to increase the annual total of 2,500 adoptions by up to 50%.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dcef7cd7-0be9-5ea5-a035-c359e262387c','6d8a8981-8225-5525-aeb4-7374b16d9363',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to reach a particular total','[ linking verb, transitive ]',null,'برای رسیدن به یک کل خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The group had losses totalling $3 million this year.","translation":"این گروه در سال جاری بالغ بر 3 میلیون دلار ضرر داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579960.mp3"},{"sentence":"Three and six make nine.","translation":"سه و شش می شوند نه.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,2),
('4f72d48f-e9e9-579a-8d0a-66078f498bdc','6d8a8981-8225-5525-aeb4-7374b16d9363',2,null,null,'informal','to damage a car so badly that it cannot be repaired','[ transitive ]',null,'به یک ماشین آنقدر آسیب برساند که قابل تعمیر نباشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Chuck totaled his dad’s new Toyota.","translation":"چاک تویوتای جدید پدرش را جمع کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000579968.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ea609a22-cba3-5147-8095-f45d6632e8ae','6715306f-be72-5cd6-b9b2-7039b6d9ae6a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a chain of petrol station s in the UK, owned by the European company TotalFinaElf',null,null,'زنجیره ای از پمپ بنزین ها در بریتانیا، متعلق به شرکت اروپایی TotalFinaElf','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('69ef0505-f68c-50a7-88c7-f8e860cbe342','c84abc00-4eff-5b15-bf7c-d33fb2afb995',1,'feel','احساس کنید','spoken & written','to put your hand, finger etc on someone or something','[ transitive ]',null,'لمس کردن، لمس؛ تأثیر گذاشتن (بر)؛ متصل شدن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She reached out to touch his arm.","translation":"دستش را دراز کرد تا بازویش را لمس کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000580177.mp3"},{"sentence":"If your house has been burgled, you shouldn’t touch anything until the police arrive.","translation":"اگر خانه شما دزدیده شده است، تا زمانی که پلیس نیاید نباید به چیزی دست بزنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000580176.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Don’t touch me!’ she yelled.","translation":"او فریاد زد: \"به من دست نزن!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791829.mp3"},{"sentence":"A hand touched her on the shoulder.","translation":"دستی روی شانه اش لمس کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791832.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('1f11d928-f44c-55e8-93a8-ae683070f6b7','c84abc00-4eff-5b15-bf7c-d33fb2afb995',2,'no space between','بدون فاصله بین','spoken & written','if two things touch, or one thing touches another thing, they reach each other so that there is no space between them','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'اگر دو چیز به هم برسند یا چیزی به چیز دیگر برسد، به همدیگر می رسند که فاصله ای بین آنها نباشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"As our glasses touched, he said ‘Cheers!’","translation":"در حالی که عینک ما به هم نزدیک شد، گفت: \"به سلامتی!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000580193.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her dress was so long that it was touching the ground.","translation":"لباسش آنقدر بلند بود که زمین را لمس می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791834.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their hands touched.","translation":"دستانشان لمس شد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Their hands touched each other.","translation":"دستانشان همدیگر را لمس کرد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"His hand touched hers.","translation":"دستش دستش را لمس کرد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('82f421f9-2bcc-5287-9907-acb2a80974e7','c84abc00-4eff-5b15-bf7c-d33fb2afb995',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'touch something to something','لمس کردن، لمس؛ تأثیر گذاشتن (بر)؛ متصل شدن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f5093669-a9b4-5b5f-a7c0-e09ea9163e50','c84abc00-4eff-5b15-bf7c-d33fb2afb995',4,'affect somebody’s feelings','بر احساسات کسی تاثیر بگذارد','spoken & written','to affect someone’s emotions , especially by making them feel sympathy or sadness','[ transitive ]','touched , touching 1','تأثیر گذاشتن بر احساسات شخصی، به ویژه با ایجاد احساس همدردی یا غمگینی در آنها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her plight has touched the hearts of people around the world.","translation":"وضعیت اسفناک او قلب مردم سراسر جهان را تحت تأثیر قرار داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791843.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could sense his concern and it touched her.","translation":"می توانست نگرانی او را حس کند و او را تحت تاثیر قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791847.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('26301119-445b-58e2-9771-db0088df879d','c84abc00-4eff-5b15-bf7c-d33fb2afb995',5,'have an effect','تاثیر داشته باشد','spoken & written','to have an effect on someone or something, especially by changing or influencing them','[ transitive ]',null,'تأثیر گذاشتن بر کسی یا چیزی، به ویژه با تغییر یا تأثیرگذاری بر او','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He has touched the lives of many people.","translation":"او زندگی بسیاری از مردم را تحت تاثیر قرار داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000580274.mp3"},{"sentence":"Unemployment remains an evil that touches the whole community.","translation":"بیکاری همچنان یک شر است که کل جامعه را تحت تأثیر قرار می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791853.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was often touched by doubt (= doubt affected him ) .","translation":"غالباً مشکوک شد (= شک بر او تأثیر گذاشت ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001791854.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
