('939e7a14-1723-512c-a2b6-a5ca57d9d5de','8c85b555-6746-5e6f-af4d-fa6cacdb8e99',6,'mark','علامت گذاری کنید','spoken & written','to leave behind a track of something such as mud or dirt when you walk','[ transitive ]',null,'به جای گذاشتن ردی از چیزی مانند گل یا خاک هنگام راه رفتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Which of you boys tracked mud all over the kitchen floor?","translation":"کدام یک از شما پسرها گل و لای را در تمام کف آشپزخانه ردیابی کردید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000551804.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d7db6d6e-a992-5a77-8f3d-e3faa27af426','fcba1b6c-b06e-574e-a9ba-447f1d49a02a',1,'buying/selling','خرید/فروش','spoken & written','the activity of buying, selling , or exchanging goods within a country or between countries','[ uncountable ]','balance of trade , free trade , → trade war ( 3 )','تجارت، بازرگانی؛ معامله (کار)؛ تجارت (فرد)',array['commerce']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['international/foreign trade International trade is essential for long-term economic growth.','global/world trade We want the poorer nations to benefit from increased global trade.','the arms/timber/book etc trade Britain is heavily involved in the arms trade.','the drugs/slave trade the country’s thriving drugs trade','the tourist trade The wildlife and scenery have helped to make the tourist trade Alaska''s second industry','the retail trade (= businesses which sell goods in shops to customers ) Advertising encourages the retail trade to stock and display the product.','the wholesale trade (= businesses which sell goods in large quantities at low prices to other businesses, rather than to the general public ) In the domestic market, the wholesale trade and retail trade developed rapidly.','trade barriers ( also barriers to trade formal ) (= things that make trade between two countries more difficult or expensive, such as taxes ) The removal of trade barriers will help our trading partnership.','a trade agreement On April 3 a new trade agreement between Romania and the USA was signed.','a trade embargo (= an official order to stop trade with another country ) Delegates urged the US government to lift its trade embargo against Vietnam.','trade talks/negotiations A further round of trade talks begins this week in Geneva.','a trade deficit (= the amount by which the total goods one country sells to others is less than the amount it buys from them ) The foreign trade deficit widened by 42% compared with the previous year.','a trade surplus (= the amount by which the total goods one country sells to others is more than the amount it buys from them ) Scotch whisky is a major contributor to the UK trade balance, with a large trade surplus.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There has been a marked increase in trade between East and West.","translation":"تجارت بین شرق و غرب افزایش قابل توجهی داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000552031.mp3"},{"sentence":"international trade agreements","translation":"قراردادهای تجاری بین المللی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001736502.mp3"},{"sentence":"unfair trade practices","translation":"شیوه های تجاری ناعادلانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001736505.mp3"},{"sentence":"Trade in ivory has been banned since 1990.","translation":"تجارت عاج از سال 1990 ممنوع شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001736510.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('7f089551-7f00-5d55-9c34-c1ed332ea4cd','fcba1b6c-b06e-574e-a9ba-447f1d49a02a',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the hotel/tourist etc trade','تجارت، بازرگانی؛ معامله (کار)؛ تجارت (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['international/foreign trade International trade is essential for long-term economic growth.','global/world trade We want the poorer nations to benefit from increased global trade.','the arms/timber/book etc trade Britain is heavily involved in the arms trade.','the drugs/slave trade the country’s thriving drugs trade','the tourist trade The wildlife and scenery have helped to make the tourist trade Alaska''s second industry','the retail trade (= businesses which sell goods in shops to customers ) Advertising encourages the retail trade to stock and display the product.','the wholesale trade (= businesses which sell goods in large quantities at low prices to other businesses, rather than to the general public ) In the domestic market, the wholesale trade and retail trade developed rapidly.','trade barriers ( also barriers to trade formal ) (= things that make trade between two countries more difficult or expensive, such as taxes ) The removal of trade barriers will help our trading partnership.','a trade agreement On April 3 a new trade agreement between Romania and the USA was signed.','a trade embargo (= an official order to stop trade with another country ) Delegates urged the US government to lift its trade embargo against Vietnam.','trade talks/negotiations A further round of trade talks begins this week in Geneva.','a trade deficit (= the amount by which the total goods one country sells to others is less than the amount it buys from them ) The foreign trade deficit widened by 42% compared with the previous year.','a trade surplus (= the amount by which the total goods one country sells to others is more than the amount it buys from them ) Scotch whisky is a major contributor to the UK trade balance, with a large trade surplus.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
