('133be3ea-cc8b-5804-911c-3c51f128a6e1','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',1,'not correct','درست نیست','spoken & written','not correct , and not based on true facts',null,null,'نادرست، غلط؛ اشتباه (فرد)؛ بد (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['completely/totally/quite wrong I may be completely wrong.','hopelessly wrong In most cases judges are right, but in a few they are hopelessly wrong.','get something wrong They’ve got their sums wrong.','be proved wrong (= be shown to be wrong ) People do not like to be proved wrong.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Your calculations must be wrong.","translation":"محاسبات شما باید اشتباه باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505038.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think I got question 3 wrong .","translation":"فکر کنم سوال 3 رو اشتباه گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661358.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is wrong to assume that technological advance brings a higher quality of life.","translation":"این اشتباه است که فرض کنیم پیشرفت تکنولوژیکی کیفیت زندگی بالاتری را به ارمغان می آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661359.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wish you’d stop trying to prove me wrong (= show that I am wrong ) all the time.","translation":"ای کاش همیشه از تلاش برای اثبات اشتباه من (= نشان دهید که اشتباه می کنم) دست بردارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661362.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('26885723-74d0-5362-a6ad-4fe46b3d5a9d','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be wrong (about somebody/something)','نادرست، غلط؛ اشتباه (فرد)؛ بد (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['completely/totally/quite wrong I may be completely wrong.','hopelessly wrong In most cases judges are right, but in a few they are hopelessly wrong.','get something wrong They’ve got their sums wrong.','be proved wrong (= be shown to be wrong ) People do not like to be proved wrong.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6dcce34a-0c68-5359-839c-3b6325127370','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',3,'problems','مشکلات','spoken & written','used to describe a situation where there are problems, or when someone is ill or unhappy',null,null,'برای توصیف موقعیتی که در آن مشکلاتی وجود دارد یا زمانی که شخصی بیمار یا ناراضی است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"When he didn’t come back that night, I knew that something was wrong.","translation":"وقتی آن شب برنگشت، فهمیدم که چیزی اشتباه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661385.mp3"},{"sentence":"What is wrong with our society? People just don’t seem to care anymore.","translation":"مشکل جامعه ما چیست؟ به نظر می رسد که مردم دیگر اهمیتی نمی دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00975.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is anything wrong? You haven’t said more than two words since you got here.","translation":"آیا چیزی اشتباه است؟ از وقتی به اینجا رسیدی دو کلمه بیشتر نگفتی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661391.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dave’s got something wrong with his foot.","translation":"دیو با پایش مشکل دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661394.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t worry, there’s nothing wrong .","translation":"نگران نباشید، هیچ مشکلی وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661398.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('639c237c-02ee-5024-bfc1-e0811e8599e3','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',4,'not the right one','درست نیست','spoken & written','not the one that you intended or the one that you really want',null,null,'نه آن چیزی که در نظر داشتید یا آن چیزی که واقعاً می خواهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The letter was delivered to the wrong address.","translation":"نامه به آدرس اشتباهی تحویل داده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505049.mp3"},{"sentence":"driving on the wrong side of the road","translation":"رانندگی در سمت اشتباه جاده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505050.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ve got the wrong man. I didn’t kill her.","translation":"شما مرد اشتباهی دارید من او را نکشتم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661402.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think we went the wrong way at that last turning.","translation":"فکر می کنم در آن پیچ آخر راه را اشتباه رفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661403.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s no one called Julia here. You must have the wrong number (= wrong telephone number ) .","translation":"اینجا کسی به نام جولیا نیست. شما باید شماره اشتباه (= شماره تلفن اشتباه) داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661407.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('dee5fd37-2351-575c-ab0e-5304dadee822','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',5,'not morally right','از نظر اخلاقی درست نیست','spoken & written','not morally right or acceptable',null,null,'از نظر اخلاقی درست یا قابل قبول نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s wrong that people should have to sleep on the streets.","translation":"این اشتباه است که مردم باید در خیابان بخوابند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505067.mp3"},{"sentence":"We all accept that it is wrong to torture people.","translation":"همه ما قبول داریم که شکنجه مردم اشتباه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001820350.mp3"},{"sentence":"We weren’t doing anything wrong !","translation":"ما کار اشتباهی انجام ندادیم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661416.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s nothing wrong with making a profit, provided you don’t cheat anyone.","translation":"سود بردن اشکالی ندارد، مشروط بر اینکه کسی را فریب ندهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661426.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b297f605-9e5a-5d9d-9193-4d5d6d1f8505','10dcbde2-4e95-5701-ad95-870225655638',6,'not suitable','مناسب نیست','spoken & written','not suitable for a particular purpose , situation, or person',null,null,'برای هدف، موقعیت یا شخص خاصی مناسب نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s the wrong time of year to be planning a holiday.","translation":"زمان اشتباهی از سال برای برنامه ریزی برای تعطیلات است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505078.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anna and I were wrong for each other in dozens of ways (= not suited for a romantic relationship with each other ) .","translation":"من و آنا از ده ها جهت برای یکدیگر اشتباه کردیم (= برای یک رابطه عاشقانه با یکدیگر مناسب نبودیم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001820353.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
