('63713236-290a-5d2b-91e5-d98fe48e4b66','b4e2cf6a-7ff8-5dc7-a271-e062f1304b2e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the period of time when someone is young, especially the period when someone is a teenager','[ uncountable ]',null,'جوانی، جوان‌مردی؛ جوانی (فرد)؛ جوانی (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['spend your youth She spent her youth in India.','relive/recapture your youth (= do things you did when young, to try and experience youth again ) The band’s fans are clearly reliving their youth. The sports car is an attempt to recapture his youth.','a misspent youth (= spent doing things that were bad or not useful ) He is trying to make up for his misspent youth.','your lost youth (= the time long ago when you were young ) He wept for his lost youth.','the days/dreams/friends etc of somebody’s youth He had long ago forgotten the dreams of his youth.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many of these people had used drugs in their youth.","translation":"بسیاری از این افراد در جوانی مواد مخدر مصرف کرده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621827.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were friends when they were young .","translation":"آنها در جوانی با هم دوست بودند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,2),
('e06abc89-833b-5fe9-b614-80c5a3ee53f5','b4e2cf6a-7ff8-5dc7-a271-e062f1304b2e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a teenage boy – used especially in newspapers to show disapproval','[ countable ]',null,'یک پسر نوجوان - به ویژه در روزنامه ها برای نشان دادن مخالفت استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['spend your youth She spent her youth in India.','relive/recapture your youth (= do things you did when young, to try and experience youth again ) The band’s fans are clearly reliving their youth. The sports car is an attempt to recapture his youth.','a misspent youth (= spent doing things that were bad or not useful ) He is trying to make up for his misspent youth.','your lost youth (= the time long ago when you were young ) He wept for his lost youth.','the days/dreams/friends etc of somebody’s youth He had long ago forgotten the dreams of his youth.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a gang of youths","translation":"گروهی از جوانان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000486170.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('406ef1eb-96b9-55a1-827b-e4abbc096c3b','b4e2cf6a-7ff8-5dc7-a271-e062f1304b2e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','young people in general','[ uncountable ]',null,'به طور کلی جوانان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['spend your youth She spent her youth in India.','relive/recapture your youth (= do things you did when young, to try and experience youth again ) The band’s fans are clearly reliving their youth. The sports car is an attempt to recapture his youth.','a misspent youth (= spent doing things that were bad or not useful ) He is trying to make up for his misspent youth.','your lost youth (= the time long ago when you were young ) He wept for his lost youth.','the days/dreams/friends etc of somebody’s youth He had long ago forgotten the dreams of his youth.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The youth of today are the pensioners of tomorrow.","translation":"جوانان امروز مستمری بگیران فردا هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000486183.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7e2f0d90-4b43-5823-a7ae-05499ed387c0','b4e2cf6a-7ff8-5dc7-a271-e062f1304b2e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the quality or state of being young','[ uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت یا وضعیت جوان بودن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['spend your youth She spent her youth in India.','relive/recapture your youth (= do things you did when young, to try and experience youth again ) The band’s fans are clearly reliving their youth. The sports car is an attempt to recapture his youth.','a misspent youth (= spent doing things that were bad or not useful ) He is trying to make up for his misspent youth.','your lost youth (= the time long ago when you were young ) He wept for his lost youth.','the days/dreams/friends etc of somebody’s youth He had long ago forgotten the dreams of his youth.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Despite his youth, he had travelled alone.","translation":"با وجود جوانی، تنها سفر کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621838.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cream will restore youth and vitality to your skin.","translation":"این کرم جوانی و شادابی را به پوست شما باز می گرداند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000486188.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2201d2fe-84f9-5770-af16-e29b8ebe7e23','d84b24e4-2af6-5dc4-b417-23200d7ca580',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in or to a foreign country',null,null,'خارج از کشور، به خارج','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve never lived abroad before.","translation":"من قبلاً هرگز خارج از کشور زندگی نکرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964447.mp3"},{"sentence":"She often goes abroad on business.","translation":"او اغلب برای تجارت به خارج از کشور می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964450.mp3"},{"sentence":"We never travelled abroad when we were kids.","translation":"وقتی بچه بودیم هرگز به خارج از کشور سفر نکردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619131.mp3"},{"sentence":"A lot of goods are imported from abroad .","translation":"کالاهای زیادی از خارج وارد می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00003.mp3"},{"sentence":"The books about Harry Potter have been very popular, both at home and abroad .","translation":"کتاب‌های مربوط به هری پاتر، هم در داخل و هم در خارج از کشور بسیار محبوب بوده‌اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020004.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('41ca381c-4f24-5a42-85df-663ba804b094','d84b24e4-2af6-5dc4-b417-23200d7ca580',2,null,null,'formal','if a feeling, piece of news etc is abroad, a lot of people feel it or know about it',null,null,'اگر یک احساس، یک خبر و غیره در خارج از کشور باشد، بسیاری از مردم آن را احساس می کنند یا در مورد آن می دانند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There were rumours abroad that she was planning to resign.","translation":"شایعاتی در خارج از کشور مبنی بر اینکه او قصد استعفا دارد وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00004.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8ed8bf48-4db7-5c1d-af75-8c53ed2abaf5','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',1,'liquid/gas','مایع/گاز','spoken & written','to take in liquid , gas , or another substance from the surface or space around something',null,null,'جذب کردن (مایع، گاز، اطلاعات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Plants absorb nutrients from the soil.","translation":"گیاهان مواد مغذی را از خاک جذب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964676.mp3"},{"sentence":"Water and salts are absorbed into our bloodstream.","translation":"آب و املاح در جریان خون ما جذب می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00007.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5346f07c-82ba-5d63-ad74-147162308c20','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',2,'information','اطلاعات','spoken & written','to read or hear a large amount of new information and understand it',null,null,'برای خواندن یا شنیدن حجم زیادی از اطلاعات جدید و درک آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her capacity to absorb information is amazing.","translation":"توانایی او برای جذب اطلاعات شگفت انگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964682.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce339490-361f-5d11-960a-7545488e49ad','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',3,'interest','علاقه','spoken & written','to interest someone so much that they do not pay attention to other things',null,null,'آنقدر به کسی علاقه داشتن که به چیزهای دیگر توجه نکند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The movement and noise of the machines absorbed him completely.","translation":"حرکت و سر و صدای دستگاه ها او را کاملا جذب می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619210.mp3"},{"sentence":"Judith lay on the settee, absorbed in her book.","translation":"جودیت روی میز دراز کشیده بود و غرق کتابش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964690.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ac27a694-b224-5e8f-a1da-a6f0cd052c65','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',4,'become part of something','بخشی از چیزی شدن','spoken & written','to become part of something larger',null,null,'تبدیل شدن به بخشی از چیزی بزرگتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"California absorbs many of the legal immigrants to the US.","translation":"کالیفرنیا بسیاری از مهاجران قانونی به ایالات متحده را جذب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964699.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were soon absorbed into local village life.","translation":"ما خیلی زود جذب زندگی روستایی محلی شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964702.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4c4032f1-43a0-5fef-a050-04632098df9c','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',5,'light/heat/energy/noise','نور/گرما/انرژی/نویز','spoken & written','if something absorbs light, heat , energy , or noise , it takes it in',null,null,'اگر چیزی نور، گرما، انرژی یا صدا را جذب کند، آن را جذب می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Darker surfaces absorb heat.","translation":"سطوح تیره تر گرما را جذب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964725.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ec3c06f4-9ce2-5b6d-9014-33e59a206dda','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',6,'deal with change/costs','مقابله با تغییر/هزینه ها','spoken & written','if something absorbs changes or costs , it accepts them and deals with them successfully',null,null,'اگر چیزی تغییرات یا هزینه ها را جذب کند، آنها را می پذیرد و با موفقیت با آنها برخورد می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The beer industry had absorbed a doubling of federal tax in 1991.","translation":"صنعت آبجو دو برابر مالیات فدرال را در سال 1991 جذب کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619222.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('65e6a054-3fc5-5e02-adc5-e93141b309f6','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',7,'money/time','پول/زمان','spoken & written','if something absorbs money, time etc, it uses a lot of it',null,null,'اگر چیزی پول، زمان و غیره را جذب کند، مقدار زیادی از آن را مصرف می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Defence spending absorbs almost 20% of the country’s wealth.","translation":"هزینه های دفاعی تقریبا 20 درصد از ثروت کشور را جذب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964708.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7bad204d-594e-5c7e-90d6-e0c3bbd3ab73','4d49c66a-9e12-53e3-a307-1fa8ade57a66',8,'force','زور','spoken & written','to reduce the effect of a sudden violent movement',null,null,'برای کاهش اثر یک حرکت خشونت آمیز ناگهانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A well-designed sports shoe should absorb the impact on your feet.","translation":"یک کفش ورزشی که به خوبی طراحی شده باشد باید ضربه های وارده بر پاهای شما را جذب کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000964714.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cc485bd1-fb0e-5cc8-a6f7-e239e465b5cc','8909a0de-c8a9-5fee-9a3e-fa5f04967efe',1,'gift/offer/invitation','هدیه/پیشنهاد/دعوتنامه','spoken & written','to take something that someone offers you, or to agree to do something that someone asks you to do','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'پذیرفتن (هدیه، پیشنهاد، دعوت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer In the end I had to accept his offer of £4,500.','accept an invitation Are you going to accept their invitation to the wedding?','accept help Don’t be afraid to accept help if you need it.','accept aid Egypt gratefully accepted American economic aid.','accept assistance They were ready to accept French military assistance.','accept a challenge To protect the environment we must accept some difficult challenges.','accept an award Miller accepted the award for best comedy show.','accept an opportunity I wish that I’d accepted the opportunity to retire when it was offered.','accept a gift/present Accepting presents from him made her feel uncomfortable.','accept a job She was desperate for money so she accepted the job.','accept a lift British English , accept a ride American English I had been taught not to accept lifts from strangers.','accept a bribe The president’s family and friends accepted massive bribes in exchange for official favours.','gladly/willingly/readily accept She invited him for a drink and he gladly accepted.','gratefully accept He gratefully accepted Athena’s help.','graciously accept She accepted her gift graciously.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Rick accepted her offer of coffee.","translation":"ریک پیشنهاد قهوه او را پذیرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000965259.mp3"},{"sentence":"He accepted the invitation to stay with us.","translation":"او دعوت را پذیرفت تا پیش ما بماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654659.mp3"},{"sentence":"His school reports said that he is always ready to accept a challenge (= agree to do something difficult ) .","translation":"گزارش های مدرسه او می گوید که او همیشه آماده پذیرش یک چالش است (= موافقت با انجام کاری دشوار).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654665.mp3"},{"sentence":"Please accept this small gift.","translation":"لطفا این هدیه کوچک را بپذیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654672.mp3"},{"sentence":"They offered me a job and I accepted.","translation":"به من پیشنهاد کار دادند و من پذیرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654673.mp3"},{"sentence":"He accepted a glass of water from Helen.","translation":"او یک لیوان آب از هلن پذیرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000965264.mp3"},{"sentence":"He readily accepted her invitation (= accepted it quickly ) .","translation":"دعوت او را به آسانی پذیرفت (= به سرعت پذیرفت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001776732.mp3"},{"sentence":"He decided to take her up on her offer .","translation":"او تصمیم گرفت که او را به پیشنهاد او قبول کند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,8),
('07db4e6d-f32b-5652-8a06-837046786a25','8909a0de-c8a9-5fee-9a3e-fa5f04967efe',2,'situation/problem etc','وضعیت/مشکل و غیره','spoken & written','to decide that there is nothing you can do to change a difficult and unpleasant situation or fact and continue with your normal life','[ transitive ]',null,'تصمیم بگیرید که هیچ کاری نمی توانید انجام دهید تا یک موقعیت یا واقعیت دشوار و ناخوشایند را تغییر دهید و به زندگی عادی خود ادامه دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer In the end I had to accept his offer of £4,500.','accept an invitation Are you going to accept their invitation to the wedding?','accept help Don’t be afraid to accept help if you need it.','accept aid Egypt gratefully accepted American economic aid.','accept assistance They were ready to accept French military assistance.','accept a challenge To protect the environment we must accept some difficult challenges.','accept an award Miller accepted the award for best comedy show.','accept an opportunity I wish that I’d accepted the opportunity to retire when it was offered.','accept a gift/present Accepting presents from him made her feel uncomfortable.','accept a job She was desperate for money so she accepted the job.','accept a lift British English , accept a ride American English I had been taught not to accept lifts from strangers.','accept a bribe The president’s family and friends accepted massive bribes in exchange for official favours.','gladly/willingly/readily accept She invited him for a drink and he gladly accepted.','gratefully accept He gratefully accepted Athena’s help.','graciously accept She accepted her gift graciously.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s not going to change, and you just have to accept it.","translation":"او تغییر نخواهد کرد، و شما فقط باید آن را بپذیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000965297.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have to accept that this is not an ideal world.","translation":"ما باید بپذیریم که این یک دنیای ایده آل نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654680.mp3"},{"sentence":"He can''t accept the fact that his problems are his own fault.","translation":"او نمی تواند این واقعیت را بپذیرد که مشکلاتش تقصیر خودش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00009.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('769c48cb-2252-5f51-9199-9a8767236b4c','8909a0de-c8a9-5fee-9a3e-fa5f04967efe',3,'think somebody/something is good enough','فکر کن کسی / چیزی به اندازه کافی خوب است','spoken & written','to decide that someone has the necessary skill or intelligence for a particular job , course etc or that a piece of work is good enough','[ transitive ]',null,'تصمیم گیری در مورد اینکه فردی مهارت یا هوش لازم را برای یک شغل خاص، دوره آموزشی و غیره دارد یا اینکه یک کار به اندازه کافی خوب است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer In the end I had to accept his offer of £4,500.','accept an invitation Are you going to accept their invitation to the wedding?','accept help Don’t be afraid to accept help if you need it.','accept aid Egypt gratefully accepted American economic aid.','accept assistance They were ready to accept French military assistance.','accept a challenge To protect the environment we must accept some difficult challenges.','accept an award Miller accepted the award for best comedy show.','accept an opportunity I wish that I’d accepted the opportunity to retire when it was offered.','accept a gift/present Accepting presents from him made her feel uncomfortable.','accept a job She was desperate for money so she accepted the job.','accept a lift British English , accept a ride American English I had been taught not to accept lifts from strangers.','accept a bribe The president’s family and friends accepted massive bribes in exchange for official favours.','gladly/willingly/readily accept She invited him for a drink and he gladly accepted.','gratefully accept He gratefully accepted Athena’s help.','graciously accept She accepted her gift graciously.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Students accepted by Stanford Law School had very high scores on the LSAT.","translation":"دانشجویان پذیرفته شده توسط دانشکده حقوق استنفورد نمرات بسیار بالایی در LSAT داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001833732.mp3"},{"sentence":"They have accepted him as the representative of the company.","translation":"ایشان را به عنوان نماینده شرکت پذیرفته اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654688.mp3"},{"sentence":"Random House accepted the book for publication.","translation":"رندوم هاوس این کتاب را برای انتشار پذیرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000008.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6d2ea7d3-9c58-5f09-abc4-47141e58feea','8909a0de-c8a9-5fee-9a3e-fa5f04967efe',4,'become part of a group','بخشی از یک گروه شوید','spoken & written','to allow someone to become part of a group, society , or organization , and to treat them in the same way as the other members','[ transitive ]',null,'اجازه دادن به شخصی برای تبدیل شدن به بخشی از یک گروه، جامعه یا سازمان، و رفتاری مشابه با سایر اعضا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer In the end I had to accept his offer of £4,500.','accept an invitation Are you going to accept their invitation to the wedding?','accept help Don’t be afraid to accept help if you need it.','accept aid Egypt gratefully accepted American economic aid.','accept assistance They were ready to accept French military assistance.','accept a challenge To protect the environment we must accept some difficult challenges.','accept an award Miller accepted the award for best comedy show.','accept an opportunity I wish that I’d accepted the opportunity to retire when it was offered.','accept a gift/present Accepting presents from him made her feel uncomfortable.','accept a job She was desperate for money so she accepted the job.','accept a lift British English , accept a ride American English I had been taught not to accept lifts from strangers.','accept a bribe The president’s family and friends accepted massive bribes in exchange for official favours.','gladly/willingly/readily accept She invited him for a drink and he gladly accepted.','gratefully accept He gratefully accepted Athena’s help.','graciously accept She accepted her gift graciously.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The children gradually began to accept her as one of the family.","translation":"بچه ها کم کم او را به عنوان یکی از خانواده پذیرفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000965316.mp3"},{"sentence":"It often takes years for immigrants to be accepted into the host community.","translation":"اغلب سال ها طول می کشد تا مهاجران در جامعه میزبا