('90b54cd1-bbf9-576a-a5cf-a8c1cc0c7abe','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',1,'reply','پاسخ دهید','spoken & written','something you say when you reply to a question that someone has asked you','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'پاسخ، جواب؛ پاسخ (به مسئله)',array['response']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an honest/straight answer The honest answer is that I don’t know.','a definite answer (= that says yes or no definitely ) Can you give me a definite answer tomorrow?','a satisfactory answer I didn’t get a satisfactory answer from the company.','give somebody an answer I’ll give you an answer tomorrow.','get/receive an answer She wrote to him but she never got an answer.','wait for an answer Kate was looking at me, waiting for an answer.','think of an answer She couldn’t think of a suitable answer to his question.','the short answer is ... (= used when giving a simple, honest, or direct answer to a difficult question ) ‘How does homeopathy work?’ ‘The short answer to this question is that we do not know how homeopathic remedies work.’']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You don’t have to give them an answer now.","translation":"شما مجبور نیستید اکنون به آنها پاسخ دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913144.mp3"},{"sentence":"Every time I ask him about it, I get a different answer .","translation":"هر بار که از او در این مورد می پرسم، پاسخ متفاوتی دریافت می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913150.mp3"},{"sentence":"These are important questions, and we want answers to them.","translation":"اینها سؤالات مهمی هستند و ما می خواهیم به آنها پاسخ دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913157.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s still waiting for an answer from the school.","translation":"او هنوز منتظر پاسخ مدرسه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913158.mp3"},{"sentence":"The honest answer was that I didn’t know.","translation":"پاسخ صادقانه این بود که من نمی دانستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913162.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was never able to get a straight answer about why it happened.","translation":"او هرگز نتوانست پاسخی مستقیم در مورد اینکه چرا این اتفاق افتاده است دریافت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913166.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer at this time.","translation":"در حال حاضر برای من غیرممکن است که به شما پاسخ قطعی بدهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913173.mp3"},{"sentence":"The short answer is that it can’t be done.","translation":"پاسخ کوتاه این است که نمی توان آن را انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913170.mp3"},{"sentence":"In answer to your question , yes, you can go.","translation":"در پاسخ به سوال شما، بله، می توانید بروید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913179.mp3"},{"sentence":"If it’s money you want, the answer is no !","translation":"اگر پولی است که می خواهید، پاسخ منفی است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913180.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('b31730e4-db09-5a33-946b-50241d3edc6a','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',2,'test/competition etc','آزمون/مسابقه و غیره','spoken & written','something that you write or say in reply to a question in a test or competition','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که در پاسخ به یک سوال در آزمون یا مسابقه می نویسید یا می گویید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"What was the answer to question 4?","translation":"جواب سوال 4 چی بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981304.mp3"},{"sentence":"Score two points for each correct answer.","translation":"برای هر پاسخ صحیح دو امتیاز بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656931.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3094f9fa-58eb-592a-bd62-80c4c42cbfd0','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',3,'invitation/letter etc','دعوت نامه / نامه و غیره','spoken & written','a written reply to a letter, invitation , advertisement etc','[ countable ]',null,'پاسخ کتبی به نامه، دعوت نامه، آگهی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Did you ever get an answer to your letter?","translation":"آیا تا به حال پاسخ نامه خود را دریافت کرده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981311.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d5bd8c9c-1b33-5600-9912-f650b1f95828','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',4,'problem','مشکل','spoken & written','a way of dealing with a problem','[ countable ]',null,'راهی برای مقابله با یک مشکل',array['solution']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is no simple answer.","translation":"پاسخ ساده ای وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656938.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police do not have an answer to rising crime.","translation":"پلیس پاسخی به افزایش جرم و جنایت ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656941.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some people think cars should be banned from the city, but I don’t think that’s the answer.","translation":"برخی از مردم فکر می کنند که خودروها باید در شهر ممنوع شوند، اما من فکر نمی کنم این راه حل باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656942.mp3"},{"sentence":"If he could get a job, it’d be the answer to all his worries.","translation":"اگر او می توانست شغلی پیدا کند، این پاسخ همه نگرانی های او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981321.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4f1f478c-d641-5a5e-9da3-457297a6837a','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',5,'on the phone','روی تلفن','spoken & written','if you get an answer when you call someone on the phone , they pick up the phone and talk to you','[ singular, uncountable usually in negative ]',null,'اگر وقتی با کسی تلفنی تماس می‌گیرید، پاسخی دریافت می‌کنید، او تلفن را برمی‌دارد و با شما صحبت می‌کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I tried calling him all day but couldn’t get an answer.","translation":"تمام روز سعی کردم با او تماس بگیرم اما جوابی دریافت نکردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981326.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('74d2e00f-c2e0-5576-9f85-af69292563b5','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',6,'at the door','در درب','spoken & written','if you get an answer when you knock on a door, someone opens it and talks to you','[ singular, uncountable usually in negative ]',null,'اگر وقتی دری را می کوبید پاسخی دریافت می کنید، یکی در را باز می کند و با شما صحبت می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I tried knocking on her door, but there was no answer .","translation":"سعی کردم در خانه اش را بزنم، اما جوابی نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656951.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b5eb400a-3b4e-5062-8e27-638f4ebad201','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'have/know all the answers','پاسخ، جواب؛ پاسخ (به مسئله)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a02ec0af-c21f-52ab-89fc-b7a54d3ed888','f6a99631-7f20-5dc0-882d-e96072d6ca23',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'somebody’s answer to something','پاسخ، جواب؛ پاسخ (به مسئله)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('70a377cf-cf88-5393-8907-ba1cdf559b6c','80e33097-75a5-50e2-b8dd-1e51fe0514f2',1,'reply','پاسخ دهید','spoken & written','to say something to someone as a reply when they have asked you a question, made a suggestion etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'پاسخ دادن، جواب دادن؛ پاسخ گفتن به تلفن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She thought for a moment before answering.","translation":"قبل از جواب دادن لحظه ای فکر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656958.mp3"},{"sentence":"He still hadn’t answered my question .","translation":"او هنوز به سوال من پاسخ نداده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656959.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Why don’t you just leave?’ ‘I’d like to, ’ she answered, ‘but I have nowhere else to go.’","translation":"او پاسخ داد: «چرا نمی‌روی؟» «من می‌خواهم، اما جای دیگری برای رفتن ندارم.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656965.mp3"},{"sentence":"When questioned, Hughes answered that he knew nothing about the robbery.","translation":"هنگامی که از هیوز سؤال شد، پاسخ داد که او چیزی در مورد سرقت نمی داند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981349.mp3"},{"sentence":"How much was it? Come on, answer me.","translation":"چقدر بود؟ بیا جوابمو بده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981352.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f63f2c1f-3b0c-5d64-b6d7-377cd29fd975','80e33097-75a5-50e2-b8dd-1e51fe0514f2',2,'test','تست کنید','spoken & written','to write or say the answer to a question in a test or competition','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای نوشتن یا گفتن پاسخ یک سوال در آزمون یا مسابقه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Answer as many questions as possible in the time provided.","translation":"در زمان مقرر تا حد امکان به سوالات پاسخ دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000981370.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
