('c795db0c-0276-559b-9434-11929fc0fae6','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',1,'violence against somebody/something','خشونت علیه کسی/چیزی','spoken & written','an act of violence that is intended to hurt a person or damage a place','[ countable ]',null,'حمله، تهاجم؛ انتقاد؛ نوبت حمله','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a bomb attack (= usually intended to achieve a political aim ) Animal rights activists are believed to have carried out the bomb attack.','a terrorist attack The accused men went on trial Monday for America’s worst-ever terrorist attack.','a knife/gun attack He was sentenced to nine years in prison for the knife attack.','an arson attack (= intended to destroy a building by burning it ) Ten classrooms were completely destroyed in the arson attack.','a violent/vicious/brutal attack Police described it as an extremely violent attack.','a horrific attack ''This was a horrific attack, '' said Detective Chief Superintendent Ron Astles.','a frenzied attack (= very violent and uncontrolled ) The woman was stabbed to death in a frenzied attack at her home.','a racial attack Staffordshire police are treating the incident as a racial attack.','a sexual attack There was no indication of a sexual attack.','an unprovoked attack (= in which the victim did nothing to cause the attack ) Their teenage son was knocked to the ground, kicked and punched in an unprovoked attack.','a motiveless attack (= that happens for no reason ) He was stabbed to death in an apparently motiveless attack.','carry out an attack The man who carried out the attack has been described as white and 25 to 32 years old.','an attack happens/takes place ( also an attack occurs formal ) The attack took place at around 10 pm Thursday.','a series/spate/wave of attacks (= a number of attacks in a row ) The killing follows a series of brutal attacks on tourists.','the victim of an attack She was the victim of an attack in her own home.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There have been several attacks on foreigners recently.","translation":"اخیراً چندین حمله به خارجی ها صورت گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995227.mp3"},{"sentence":"a bomb attack","translation":"یک حمله بمبی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001783481.mp3"},{"sentence":"a knife attack","translation":"حمله با چاقو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659849.mp3"},{"sentence":"an arson attack (= an attempt to destroy a building using fire )","translation":"حمله آتش سوزی (= تلاش برای تخریب ساختمان با استفاده از آتش)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659850.mp3"},{"sentence":"victims of racial attacks","translation":"قربانیان حملات نژادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659854.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('44c55ef8-223a-5d24-b837-27671790c18b','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',2,'in a war','در یک جنگ','spoken & written','the act of using weapons against an enemy in a war','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'عمل استفاده از سلاح علیه دشمن در جنگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The attack began at dawn.","translation":"حمله در سحرگاه آغاز شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995234.mp3"},{"sentence":"the attack on Pearl Harbor","translation":"حمله به پرل هاربر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995237.mp3"},{"sentence":"Once again we came under attack from enemy fighter planes.","translation":"بار دیگر مورد حمله هواپیماهای جنگنده دشمن قرار گرفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995240.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rebel forces launched (= started ) an attack late Sunday night.","translation":"نیروهای شورشی در اواخر شب یکشنبه حمله ای را آغاز کردند (= شروع کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659856.mp3"},{"sentence":"the threat of nuclear attack","translation":"تهدید حمله هسته ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000249304.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('af637b56-bde2-5dd8-a106-8a9c509755bd','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',3,'criticism','انتقاد','spoken & written','a strong and direct criticism of someone or something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'انتقاد شدید و مستقیم از کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The magazine recently published a vicious personal attack on the novelist.","translation":"این مجله اخیراً حمله شخصی وحشیانه به این رمان نویس را منتشر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659867.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company has come under fierce attack for its decision to close the factory.","translation":"این شرکت به دلیل تصمیم خود برای تعطیلی کارخانه مورد حمله شدید قرار گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995256.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7e5c04bc-52e2-517e-85c2-48dffdc303be','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',4,'illness','بیماری','spoken & written','a sudden short period of suffering from an illness , especially an illness that you have often','[ countable ]','heart attack','یک دوره کوتاه ناگهانی رنج کشیدن از یک بیماری، به ویژه بیماری که اغلب دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had a bad attack of flu at Christmas.","translation":"در کریسمس یک حمله بد آنفولانزا داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659874.mp3"},{"sentence":"He died after suffering a severe asthma attack .","translation":"او پس از حمله شدید آسم درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659875.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d9f9c5fa-e406-5804-9316-bd527cf35601','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',5,'emotion','احساس','spoken & written','a short period of time when you suddenly feel extremely frightened or worried and cannot think normally or deal with the situation','[ countable ]',null,'یک دوره کوتاه زمانی که ناگهان احساس ترس یا نگرانی شدید و نمی توانید به طور عادی فکر کنید یا با موقعیت کنار بیایید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her heart began to pound frantically, as if she were having a panic attack.","translation":"قلبش دیوانه وار شروع به تپیدن کرد، انگار که دچار حمله وحشت شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659889.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sudden attack of nerves","translation":"حمله ناگهانی اعصاب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659892.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('56384aba-c2f9-5e48-8c0c-30a26e7a10f5','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',6,'attempt to stop something','تلاش برای متوقف کردن چیزی','spoken & written','actions that are intended to get rid of or stop something such as a system, a set of laws etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'اقداماتی که به منظور خلاص شدن از شر یا متوقف کردن چیزی مانند یک سیستم، مجموعه ای از قوانین و غیره است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The new measures were seen by many as an attack on the Scottish way of life.","translation":"اقدامات جدید از نظر بسیاری به عنوان حمله ای به سبک زندگی اسکاتلندی تلقی می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000995268.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a199f711-0524-5cf8-a71c-f8805d2e2f15','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',7,'sport','ورزش','spoken & written','an attempt by a player or group of players to score goal s or win points','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تلاش یک بازیکن یا گروهی از بازیکنان برای به ثمر رساندن گل یا کسب امتیاز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Heath will play alongside Smith in attack.","translation":"هیث در خط حمله در کنار اسمیت بازی خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659916.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0dd96ec0-34bd-5d1c-a2cc-594de5611e7e','470a0e38-f9fe-5e66-af9c-466b3851ac05',8,'damage','آسیب','spoken & written','when something such as a disease, insect , or chemical damages something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'هنگامی که چیزی مانند بیماری، حشره یا مواد شیمیایی به چیزی آسیب می رساند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Unfortunately, the carved ceilings have suffered woodworm attack over the years.","translation":"متأسفانه سقف های کنده کاری شده در طول سال ها دچار حمله کرم های چوبی شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659924.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
